## COMMUNICATION
BIT-66 \((\mathsf{V}_{3}(\mathsf{O})_{3}(\mathsf{H}_{2}\mathsf{O})(\mathsf{B T B})_{2})\), possesses prominent moisture tunability in the range of \(45\%\) - \(60\%\) RH, showing good recyclability and excellent performance in water adsorption-desorption cycles. Importantly, this MOF demonstrates a unique photocatalytic bacteriostatic behavior under visible light, which can effectively ameliorate the bacteria and/or mold breeding problem in water adsorbing materials.
